+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git.
+
+## Intent
+
+Build TodoMVC per `assets/app-spec.md` from `assets/app-template.index.html`. Vanilla JS, no preprocessors, localStorage persistence. Cucumber test runner with happy-dom for DOM-level scenarios.
+
+## Authored specs
+
+Four feature files written under `features/`:
+- `todo-management.feature` — add, display, toggle, delete, mark-all, clear-completed, counter, empty state
+- `todo-editing.feature` — inline edit, blur/enter save, empty destroy, escape cancel
+- `persistence.feature` — localStorage save/load, completed state, editing-not-persisted, filter selection
+- `routing.feature` — hash-based all/active/completed filtering, filter persistence
+
+## Watchbill
+
+`watchbill.json` orders verification at `features/todo-management.feature` first (core behaviour), then persistence, editing, routing.
+
+## Deck
