@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+Feature: Persistence
+  As a user
+  I want my todos to persist across page reloads
+  So that I do not lose my tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist after page reload
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Persist this"
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then I see a todo with the title "Persist this"
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists after page reload
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Persist this"
+    And the todo "Persist this" is completed
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Persist this" has the completed class
+
+  Scenario: Editing mode is not persisted after page reload
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Persist this"
+    And the todo "Persist this" is in editing mode
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Persist this" does not have the editing class
+
+  Scenario: Active filter selection persists after page reload
+    Given I have added todos titled "Task A" and "Task B"
+    And "Task A" is completed
+    And I click the "Active" filter
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the "Active" filter link has the selected class
+    And I see only active todos in the list
