@@ -0,0 +1,76 @@
+Feature: Todo Management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage my todo items
+  So that I can keep track of tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Adding a new todo creates an item in the list
+    When I type "Buy groceries" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then I see a todo item with the title "Buy groceries"
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given there are no todos in the list
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer section is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are shown when a todo exists
+    When I add a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer section is visible
+
+  Scenario: Toggling a todo marks it as completed
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Finish report"
+    When I toggle the todo "Finish report" as completed
+    Then the todo "Finish report" has the completed class
+    And its checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggling a completed todo marks it as active
+    Given I have a completed todo titled "Buy milk"
+    When I toggle the todo "Buy milk" as active
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have the completed class
+    And its checkbox is not checked
+
+  Scenario: Deleting a todo removes it from the list
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Delete me"
+    When I click the destroy button for "Delete me"
+    Then I do not see a todo with the title "Delete me"
+
+  Scenario: Marking all todos as complete
+    Given I have added todos titled "Task A" and "Task B"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos have the completed class
+
+  Scenario: Clearing all completed todos
+    Given I have added todos titled "Task A" and "Task B"
+    And "Task A" is completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then I do not see a todo with the title "Task A"
+    And I see a todo with the title "Task B"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Task A"
+    And "Task A" is not completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when a todo is completed
+    Given I have added a todo titled "Task A"
+    And "Task A" is completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  Scenario: Active item count displays correctly
+    Given I have added todos titled "Task A" and "Task B"
+    And "Task A" is completed
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Active item count is pluralized
+    Given I have added todos titled "Task A" and "Task B"
+    And neither todo is completed
+    Then the todo-count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Empty input is ignored on Enter
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then no new todo item is created
